<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Demande de validation de convention</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f3f4f6; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6); padding: 36px 32px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; }
        .header p { color: #c4b5fd; margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 14px; }
        .body { padding: 32px; }
        .greeting { font-size: 16px; color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .text { font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .info-box { background: #f5f3ff; border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .info-box p { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 14px; color: #374151; }
        .info-box p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
        .info-box strong { color: #5b21b6; }
        .cta { text-align: center; margin: 28px 0; }
        .cta a { display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #7c3aed); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
        .footer { background: #f9fafb; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 20px 32px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Demande de validation de convention</h1>
        <p>Un étudiant vous soumet sa convention de stage pour validation</p>
    </div>

    <div class="body">
        <p class="greeting">Bonjour {{ professor.firstName }} {{ professor.lastName }},</p>

        <p class="text">
            L'étudiant(e) <strong>{{ convention.student.firstName }} {{ convention.student.lastName }}</strong>
            vous soumet sa convention de stage pour validation. En tant que professeur référent, votre approbation est nécessaire pour que la convention puisse être établie.
        </p>

        <div class="info-box">
            <p><strong>Étudiant(e) :</strong> {{ convention.student.firstName }} {{ convention.student.lastName }}</p>
            {% if convention.companyInfo %}
                <p><strong>Entreprise :</strong> {{ convention.companyInfo.companyName }}</p>
                {% if convention.companyInfo.city %}
                    <p><strong>Lieu :</strong> {{ convention.companyInfo.city }}{% if convention.companyInfo.country %}, {{ convention.companyInfo.country }}{% endif %}</p>
                {% endif %}
                {% if convention.companyInfo.internshipStartDate and convention.companyInfo.internshipEndDate %}
                    <p><strong>Période :</strong> {{ convention.companyInfo.internshipStartDate|date('d/m/Y') }} → {{ convention.companyInfo.internshipEndDate|date('d/m/Y') }}</p>
                {% endif %}
                {% if convention.companyInfo.supervisorLastName %}
                    <p><strong>Maître de stage :</strong> {{ convention.companyInfo.supervisorFirstName }} {{ convention.companyInfo.supervisorLastName }}</p>
                {% endif %}
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        <p class="text">
            Cliquez sur le bouton ci-dessous pour accéder directement à la convention et la valider :
        </p>

        <div class="cta">
            <a href="{{ conventionUrl }}">Voir et valider la convention</a>
        </div>

        <p class="text" style="font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af;">
            Si le bouton ne fonctionne pas, copiez ce lien dans votre navigateur :<br>
            <a href="{{ conventionUrl }}" style="color: #7c3aed; word-break: break-all;">{{ conventionUrl }}</a>
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>Conventio — Gestion des conventions de stage</p>
        <p>Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement, merci de ne pas y répondre.</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
